<div class="page">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>Your channel name, picture and other details stay in your browser. They are used to draw the preview and the files on your device and are never uploaded.</p>
  <h2>What leaves your device</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Checkout:</strong> Lemon Squeezy collects your email address and payment details to take payment and send your receipt. See their privacy policy.</li>
    <li><strong>Unlocking:</strong> your licence key is sent to our server, which checks it with Lemon Squeezy and returns an unlock. We store the order number and whether it was refunded. We don't store your email address.</li>
    <li><strong>Visits:</strong> we count page visits with Cloudflare Web Analytics, which uses no cookies and doesn't track you across sites.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>What's stored in your browser</h2>
  <p>Your details, a small copy of your picture, your export settings and your unlocks, in local storage. Clear your browser's site data to remove them.</p>
</div>
